# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC (studiolabsoftware-code/studiolab-growth-onboarding).
# outputs/ is the working deliverables folder, so it holds material that must
# never be published. Plans and runbooks in outputs/ are still committed by
# hand; these patterns stop an accidental `git add -A` from sweeping in the
# rest. Nothing here is deleted, it just stays local. To publish one on
# purpose: git add -f <path>
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

